   <button class="mode-card" data-mode="20-day" aria-pressed="true"><span class="mode-tag">标准旅程 · ${vt["20-day"].lureSlots}拟饵</span><strong>${vt["20-day"].days}<small>天</small></strong><span class="mode-name">湖心远征</span><span class="mode-description">积累拟饵，构筑属于你的钓鱼节奏。</span><span class="mode-check">已选择 ✓</span></button>
